{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22746","headline":"送人贬信州判官 · 白居易","name":"送人贬信州判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地僻山深古上饶，土风贫薄道程遥。\n不唯迁客须恓屑，见说居人也寂寥。\n溪畔毒沙藏水弩，城头枯树下山魈。\n若於此郡爲卑吏，刺史厅前又折腰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}